  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a sygican ranged weapon.</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You know how to overpower your weapon with multiple sygican Engrams. As part of you Ingraving an Engram on your weapon, you can Ingrave a second Engram it has. This drains the battery on the weapon used equal to how much those Ingravings would cost, and this counts as using the Engram for the purposes of frequencies, if any.</p>"
